  "description": "Managed wrapper around the VeraCrypt volume core: create, open, read and\n      write VeraCrypt encrypted containers (normal and hidden volumes, all\n      cipher/KDF combinations, keyfiles, PIM) without mounting them. Pulls in\n      the matching HCVault.Native package (prebuilt native libraries for\n      Windows, Linux and Android) automatically; build your own from the\n      repository sources with CMake if you need another platform.",
  "iconFile": "nuget-icon.png",
  "id": "HCVault.Core",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-16T13:50:57.947Z",
